2 T\u00fcrk\u00e7e ve \u0130ngilizce dil deste\u011fi\n\n\u2022 Ger\u00e7ek\u00e7i hidrolik, motor ve palet ses efektleri\n\nHaz\u0131r m\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z? Sahaya \u00e7\u0131k\u0131n, makineleri \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n ve g\u00f6reve ba\u015flay\u0131n.\n\nKAZ, YIK, PAR\u00c7ALA !!!", "short_description": "Ger\u00e7ek\u00e7i fizik motoru, detayl\u0131 ekskavat\u00f6r kontrolleri ve sahici g\u00f6rev yap\u0131s\u0131yla Excavator Simulator Remake, sizi do\u011frudan i\u015f sahas\u0131n\u0131n merkezine ta\u015f\u0131yor. Geli\u015ftirilmi\u015f grafikler, optimize edilmi\u015f kamera ge\u00e7i\u015fleri ve zenginle\u015ftirilmi\u015f sahne tasar\u0131m\u0131yla hem teknik hem e\u011flenceli bir sim\u00fclasyon deneyimi sunuyor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero.png", "id": "3481351548698159", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620860_3481351552031492_1670744784609445573_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dIoVX0sj50oQ7kNvwHZxPba&_nc_oc=Ado99KjfccSE79AzAZcqvU4ETOifrH7eu5Lc7GvAg6VKegjlvGoLGztI1z8G2ksrCLE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQGtQiAzr36xxvZiAiH8iWYfHVOmg1DQx4mT-nleftL6Q&oe=6B0C618D"}, {"file_name": "Cover_PT.png", "id": "2523756758062144", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819862_2523756761395477_8964245330675202189_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bTieROonGWoQ7kNvwHIjXTz&_nc_oc=Adr1Sush4PLETm3i6Cl6YozyXTj1gkqawGxCk0crocHDpW1358IF01xubERG2h5TkvQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTLxxhbgS3xENrh4OJEapZpbE80_2E3UWxWjUNjr2_lYw&oe=6B0C6152"}, {"file_name": "Cover_SQ.png", "id": "2466733217177514", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623345_2466733220510847_1376104428758864047_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map